# Secret names that the Worker reads, with empty values. Copy this file to .dev.vars (ignored by Git) for local runs.
# Never put a value in this file. Production secrets are set with `wrangler secret put` by the delivery job.
# TOKEN_SIGNING_KEY: base64url of at least 32 random bytes, for example the output of `openssl rand -base64 48`
# with the characters + and / replaced by - and _ and the padding removed.
TOKEN_SIGNING_KEY=
# AGENT_RUNNER_URL: the https base URL of the Fly agent runner. AGENT_RUNNER_CREDENTIAL: the credential of the workflows
# service principal (the bootstrap command issues it). The scheduled dispatcher uses both; without them agent work is not sent.
AGENT_RUNNER_URL=
AGENT_RUNNER_CREDENTIAL=
